                        "review": "A strong sequel to Ship of Spirits, although the first game remains my favourite.\n\nSummary:  Excellent HOPA, recommend adding to any HO/HOPA library.\n\n- variety of HO scenes\n- nice art\n- good story (for the genre)\n- interesting puzzles (vary from easy to somewhat challenging; good mix)\n- two kinds of collectables (morphing objects; humming birds)\n- interactive map (but collectables not shown)\n- good user interface\n- handy notebook\n- mostly good voice acting\n\nThe game ran smoothly for me.  This is a good series so far.",
